Read AGENTS.md in full, docs/cursor.md, docs/roadmap.md and docs/status.md before work.
Roadmap Amendment 11 authorizes the Cursor alternative: Grok coordinates and reviews routine
PRs; Composer implements routine issues and explores; Opus handles security-critical work.
The primary Architect selects Grok 4.7, high effort, standard speed in Cursor's model picker.
Use the explicit cursor-* roles in .cursor/agents/, never implicit inherited models for
these roles. Verify which model actually ran; a substituted model blocks that role.
One issue/PR/worktree per writer. Independent current-head PASS plus green CI is required
before the Architect may enqueue a merge. The author's self-check is not independent review.
When in doubt classify as security-critical and use Opus. If an independent reviewer or the
required model is unavailable, leave the PR open and continue independent work.
All shared safety, secret handling, fake-only testing and live-action authorization rules apply.
